WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.543
I'm done!

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:04.129
I'm done, I'm done, I'm done,
I'm done, I'm done!

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.464
I'm done!

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:08.717
I'm all done!

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.634
With what?

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.596
My farewell address for
the graduation ceremony.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.973
I finally finished it.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:16.891
I've been worrying about it for so long.

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:20.312
See you later!

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:23.148
Good morning, Mom!

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:23.940
Good morning.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.151
The weather's great again today!

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:30.822
Honoka-san didn't notice our clothes...

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:33.158
She completely missed them.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.870
Sorry, I forgot to mention.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.749
You two look great. Fight!

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:45.587
LETS GO DO IDO/ILIVE
LET'S GO! DO! I DO! I LIVE!

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:49.883
YES DO I DO I LIVE
YES, DO!1 DO! I LIVE!

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.469
LETS GO LETS GO HI
LET'S GO, LET'S GO! Yeah!

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:58.183
#13 - May Everyone's Dream Come True! That's me—Kosaka
Honoka. I'm the student council president of Otonokizaka High.

00:00:58.183 --> 00:01:00.435
Today is a very important day for me,

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:03.855
Otonokizaka High Graduation Ceremony
because...

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:05.357
Hey!

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:06.608
Honoka-chan, good morning.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:09.611
Good morning! Where is everyone?

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:12.072
We just got here.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.740
Nico-chan's over there.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.450
Honoka-san.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:16.534
It's good to see you again.

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:17.952
M's.

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:20.538
It's good to see you guys again.

00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:21.665
Nico-chan, good morning.

00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:23.958
Oh, my.

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:27.379
That's...not Nico-chan!

00:01:27.379 --> 00:01:28.505
Nice to meet you.

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:31.007
You know who we are?

00:01:31.007 --> 00:01:31.925
Of course.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.720
I'm the mother of Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.138
What?

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.975
N-Nice to meet you.

00:01:40.975 --> 00:01:42.143
Mama!

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:45.689
What are you doing?
Hurry and come over here!

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:47.732
There's something I wanna show you!

00:01:47.732 --> 00:01:51.861
Hurry, Mama!

00:01:52.737 --> 00:01:54.072
Nico-chan?

00:01:58.660 --> 00:01:59.536
Ahem.

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:01.454
Good morning.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:05.333
We discovered a surprising side of Nico-chan.

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:08.336
Here we go.

00:02:09.003 --> 00:02:10.338
Ta-da!

00:02:10.338 --> 00:02:12.048
Look. This is...

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.095
...proof of our victory!

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:19.389
It's amazing.

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:20.473
It's beautiful.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.641
Winner.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.811
We actually won...

00:02:25.061 --> 00:02:27.105
Victory!

00:02:27.105 --> 00:02:28.815
You're still saying that?

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:30.817
See? See? I told you!

00:02:32.193 --> 00:02:33.027
Congratulations.

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:36.197
But...

00:02:36.197 --> 00:02:38.867
Does all of this stuff belong to you?

00:02:39.784 --> 00:02:40.618
Huh? Um...

00:02:40.952 --> 00:02:46.166
A fowl shall not befoul the nest it is about to
leave. Make sure you clean up for everyone.

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.293
O-Okay...

00:02:48.877 --> 00:02:51.755
By the way, Honoka, don't you need to go?

00:02:51.755 --> 00:02:52.338
Huh?

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:57.093
Didn't Umi tell you that the student
council was meeting in their office

00:02:57.093 --> 00:02:59.387
two hours before the ceremony?

00:03:03.224 --> 00:03:04.434
Sorry!

00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:06.561
You're late for the graduation ceremony...?

00:03:06.561 --> 00:03:10.190
N-No, I was here at school!

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.358
There was a lot going on, and...

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.401
A lot?

00:03:13.401 --> 00:03:17.822
Umi-chan, you shouldn't get too
angry today. It's graduation.

00:03:17.822 --> 00:03:18.990
But...

00:03:19.616 --> 00:03:23.286
Anyway, did you finish
your farewell address?

00:03:23.286 --> 00:03:25.330
Yeah, for sure.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:26.498
Really?

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:30.502
I've got it in my pocket. Take a look.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.343
It sounds like you.

00:03:40.136 --> 00:03:42.180
I hope you'll help me.

00:03:42.972 --> 00:03:43.807
Like this?

00:03:43.807 --> 00:03:44.891
Yeah.

00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:47.310
Help me over here.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.686
Things are looking good!

00:03:48.686 --> 00:03:49.687
Leave it to us.

00:03:50.104 --> 00:03:54.609
Oh, right. Do you have records
from last year's graduation?

00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:55.568
Probably.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:57.779
We can't get the lighting right.

00:03:58.196 --> 00:04:00.740
It should be in the student council room.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:04.077
You want to know how
they did it last year, right?

00:04:04.077 --> 00:04:06.454
Got it. I'll go check it out.

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:14.754
Nozomi-chan!

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.173
Oh, Honoka-chan.

00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:18.633
How do I look?

00:04:18.633 --> 00:04:22.387
You look great! Nozomi-chan,
your hair is always so beautiful!

00:04:22.387 --> 00:04:24.889
You're embarrassing me.

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:27.141
But it's true.

00:04:27.642 --> 00:04:28.726
Thanks.

00:04:28.726 --> 00:04:30.270
Well then, see you later.

00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:32.188
Have you seen Eli-chi?

00:04:32.981 --> 00:04:34.399
No.

00:04:34.399 --> 00:04:38.027
I thought she was with you.

00:04:38.653 --> 00:04:41.698
I see. I'll tell her if I see her.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.125
Eli-chan.

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:54.961
What are you doing?
Nozomi-chan was looking for you.

00:04:55.378 --> 00:04:58.423
I didn't have any particular
reason for coming here.

00:04:58.423 --> 00:04:59.966
This is just where I ended up.

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.427
Are you ready for the ceremony?

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:05.930
Not quite...

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.474
But it's okay! I'll make it a fantastic ceremony!

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.810
Look forward to it!

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:13.146
Thank you.

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:14.147
Are you worried about something?

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:18.151
No. It's just...

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:22.405
While I was organizing my album yesterday,

00:05:22.405 --> 00:05:25.408
I remembered my time as the
student council president.

00:05:26.117 --> 00:05:30.204
I felt like I was under so
much pressure back then.

00:05:30.204 --> 00:05:33.750
I had no room to breathe. I was so stubborn.

00:05:35.043 --> 00:05:36.127
Eli-chan...

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:42.800
Looking back, I realized everyone
was helping me the whole time.

00:05:50.266 --> 00:05:50.850
Honoka?

00:05:51.225 --> 00:05:57.982
Eli-chan, when we almost didn't make
it to Love Live, you held me like this.

00:05:58.483 --> 00:06:00.109
We feel the same way.

00:06:01.069 --> 00:06:07.367
After becoming the student council president,
I saw lots of things that you left behind.

00:06:08.284 --> 00:06:11.287
Your love for this school.

00:06:11.287 --> 00:06:14.624
And how you cherish everyone.

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:22.715
This room is full of your feelings.

00:06:23.466 --> 00:06:26.636
That's what kept me going as
the student council president.

00:06:30.473 --> 00:06:31.891
Thank you so much.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:37.647
Jeez... Don't make me cry
before the ceremony.

00:06:39.565 --> 00:06:40.775
Well, I've gotta go.

00:06:44.612 --> 00:06:45.947
Nozomi-chan!

00:06:45.947 --> 00:06:48.032
So this is where she was.

00:06:48.533 --> 00:06:49.534
Nozomi.

00:06:50.159 --> 00:06:51.285
See you later!

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:56.749
She's grown.

00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:58.543
Yeah...

00:06:59.502 --> 00:07:02.088
Graduation
She's a...

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:05.008
Congratulations on Your Graduation
...proper student council president now.

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:29.866
Otonokizaka High will welcome new students
next year thanks to all of your efforts.

00:07:30.742 --> 00:07:33.703
As I thank you from the bottom of my heart,

00:07:33.703 --> 00:07:41.627
I also wish the graduating class well as
they head off into their brilliant futures.

00:07:42.211 --> 00:07:43.171
Congratulations.

00:07:52.221 --> 00:07:54.182
Next,

00:07:54.182 --> 00:07:59.228
we have the farewell address from the
student representative, Kosaka Honoka.

00:07:59.228 --> 00:07:59.896
Here!

00:08:04.358 --> 00:08:08.446
The farewell address from the student
representative, Kosaka Honoka.

00:08:09.113 --> 00:08:12.909
Upperclassmen, congratulations
on your graduation.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:19.499
Up until yesterday, I was thinking
about what I would say here today.

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:26.130
I couldn't find the words to
express my feelings of gratitude.

00:08:26.631 --> 00:08:29.467
No matter how many times I
rewrote it, it never came out right.

00:08:30.259 --> 00:08:31.469
That's when I realized something.

00:08:32.261 --> 00:08:35.598
I'm not very good at that kind of thing!

00:08:36.766 --> 00:08:37.850
Honoka?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:42.105
Ever since I was a little girl,
I acted before I spoke.

00:08:42.814 --> 00:08:46.317
Sometimes I caused trouble
for those around me.

00:08:46.317 --> 00:08:52.031
I was...awkward, and wasn't very
good at expressing myself.

00:08:53.491 --> 00:08:57.286
But that's when I found music!

00:08:57.954 --> 00:09:00.957
Music allows you to honestly
convey your feelings.

00:09:00.957 --> 00:09:05.044
By singing, you can feel
the same way as others.

00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:07.964
By singing, you can connect with others.

00:09:08.339 --> 00:09:11.134
That's why I love music.

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:13.970
I love singing!

00:09:14.929 --> 00:09:18.057
Upperclassmen, with gratitude in my heart,

00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:22.979
and prayers for your future success,
I send you off with this song.

00:09:30.194 --> 00:09:32.530
Aishteru banzaai
I love you, hooray!

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:35.158
Koko de yokatlta
I'm glad I'm here

00:09:35.158 --> 00:09:40.830
watashitachi no ima ga koko ni aru
Our present is here

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:43.207
aishteru banzaai
I love you, hooray!

00:09:43.207 --> 00:09:48.462
Hajimattabakari ashita mo yoroshikune It's
only just begun, thanks in advance for tomorrow

00:09:48.462 --> 00:09:54.594
mada gohru janai
We're not at the finish line yet

00:10:01.184 --> 00:10:01.767
saa
Come on!

00:10:02.185 --> 00:10:04.520
Daisukida banzaai
I love you, hooray!

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:06.731
Makenai yuuki
Our courage won't be beat

00:10:07.231 --> 00:10:12.195
watashitachi wa ima wo tanoshimou
Let's enjoy the present

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:15.198
daisukida banzaai
I love you, hooray!

00:10:15.198 --> 00:10:20.369
Ganbarerukara kinou ni te wo futte
Because I can work hard, I wave to yesterday

00:10:20.369 --> 00:10:26.626
hora mae muite
Come on, face forward

00:10:26.626 --> 00:10:28.336
All together, everyone!

00:11:00.201 --> 00:11:01.577
Love Live!

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.538
Wow!

00:11:04.538 --> 00:11:06.582
It's mostly empty.

00:11:06.582 --> 00:11:11.087
Does that mean all the stuff in
here really did belong to you?

00:11:11.087 --> 00:11:14.924
No. I was just letting you specially borrow it!

00:11:15.341 --> 00:11:16.509
Borrow it?

00:11:16.509 --> 00:11:18.094
It's all in how you say it.

00:11:18.094 --> 00:11:23.057
But it's a little sad now
that there's nothing here.

00:11:23.057 --> 00:11:25.184
You're the Idol Study Club.

00:11:25.184 --> 00:11:30.314
The next president should just
bring some things from home.

00:11:30.314 --> 00:11:32.316
The next president?

00:11:32.316 --> 00:11:34.777
That's right... We haven't chosen one yet.

00:11:37.571 --> 00:11:38.406
Hanayo.

00:11:38.406 --> 00:11:39.115
Huh?

00:11:39.615 --> 00:11:40.408
I'm counting on you.

00:11:40.866 --> 00:11:42.368
Huh? What?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.412
What!?

00:11:44.412 --> 00:11:48.374
Club President
I can't do this! Someone rescue me!

00:11:48.374 --> 00:11:51.836
I can't ask the student
council president to do it.

00:11:51.836 --> 00:11:55.589
No one knows more about idols than you.

00:11:55.589 --> 00:11:58.551
B-But the president...

00:11:58.551 --> 00:12:00.761
Even I was the leader of y's.

00:12:01.304 --> 00:12:02.805
You can do it.

00:12:02.805 --> 00:12:05.433
Yeah. You're the best choice.

00:12:05.433 --> 00:12:07.101
B-But...

00:12:07.101 --> 00:12:08.477
You can do it.

00:12:08.477 --> 00:12:14.859
You've got all these friends helping you.

00:12:18.362 --> 00:12:19.613
Nico-chan...

00:12:20.448 --> 00:12:23.034
Make this an even livelier club!

00:12:23.034 --> 00:12:24.869
I'll come back to visit!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.163
Hanayo.

00:12:27.163 --> 00:12:28.164
Kayo-chin.

00:12:28.164 --> 00:12:28.956
Hanayo-chan.

00:12:31.167 --> 00:12:34.795
The Legendary Idol Legend

00:12:36.964 --> 00:12:37.715
Okay!

00:12:40.718 --> 00:12:42.762
All right!

00:12:43.554 --> 00:12:45.473
Then Maki-chan, you're the vice president.

00:12:45.473 --> 00:12:47.725
What!? Why me?

00:12:47.725 --> 00:12:53.105
If I'm the president, and Rin-chan's the
leader, that makes you the vice president.

00:12:53.105 --> 00:12:54.398
That's great!

00:13:02.531 --> 00:13:04.784
We're counting on you, girls.

00:13:04.784 --> 00:13:07.620
W-Wait! I'm not...

00:13:08.204 --> 00:13:11.248
Sheesh! Fine, then!

00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:16.587
Now we've done everything we have to do.

00:13:16.587 --> 00:13:18.756
We should get going.

00:13:18.756 --> 00:13:21.342
What? You're leaving already?

00:13:21.342 --> 00:13:24.929
We thought we'd walk around
the school one last time.

00:13:24.929 --> 00:13:27.473
We'll go with you, then.

00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:29.016
Because, you know...

00:13:29.016 --> 00:13:32.603
This is the last time the nine
of us will be together...

00:13:34.814 --> 00:13:35.648
Huh?

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:37.775
- You said it!
- What?

00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:43.197
We promised that whoever said "the last
time" would treat everyone to juice!

00:13:43.197 --> 00:13:43.989
What!?

00:13:45.533 --> 00:13:49.328
Juice on Honoka tastes so good!

00:13:49.328 --> 00:13:50.871
Thank you, Honoka-chan.

00:13:51.288 --> 00:13:52.957
You're welcome...

00:13:52.957 --> 00:13:56.210
Now that I think about it, you
haven't eaten much bread lately...

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.964
Yeah. Since we had Love Live to
consider, I've been holding back.

00:13:59.964 --> 00:14:02.550
But you ended up having
to go on a diet anyway.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:04.969
That was because, um...

00:14:05.177 --> 00:14:08.973
It's been a while! So fluffy!

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.145
What's wrong?

00:14:14.728 --> 00:14:15.396
Nothing.

00:14:15.396 --> 00:14:17.940
They've gotten really fat.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.400
Now that you mention it...

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.234
Wait!

00:14:23.737 --> 00:14:27.032
Could this be...a baby?

00:14:27.032 --> 00:14:28.742
What!?

00:14:30.995 --> 00:14:32.955
Now things will be even more livelier!

00:14:36.375 --> 00:14:40.838
Standing here again makes
me realize how...small it is?

00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:45.426
Maybe it feels that way
because we've grown a little.

00:14:46.302 --> 00:14:48.637
I still can't believe it.

00:14:49.263 --> 00:14:49.930
Yeah.

00:14:51.432 --> 00:14:54.518
We sang on the Love Live stage...

00:15:06.447 --> 00:15:11.160
The sky was clear like this the first
time the nine of us sang together.

00:15:12.244 --> 00:15:14.371
Isn't that what you were thinking?

00:15:16.457 --> 00:15:17.124
Yes.

00:15:18.375 --> 00:15:19.376
Me, too.

00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:29.220
This is the last place.

00:15:29.678 --> 00:15:30.554
Yeah.

00:15:36.519 --> 00:15:41.607
Now that I think about it, we started here
because we had nowhere else to practice.

00:15:42.149 --> 00:15:44.652
We gathered here every day.

00:15:44.652 --> 00:15:46.111
And practiced every day.

00:15:46.487 --> 00:15:49.198
Together, we overcame everything
we couldn't do on our own.

00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:51.492
We played around and laughed together.

00:15:52.493 --> 00:15:53.869
Everything happened here.

00:16:00.918 --> 00:16:01.919
I know!

00:16:05.047 --> 00:16:06.257
Honoka-chan.

00:16:06.257 --> 00:16:06.799
Just watch.

00:16:15.015 --> 00:16:15.975
All done.

00:16:20.729 --> 00:16:22.106
M's.

00:16:22.106 --> 00:16:25.442
But it'll disappear quickly in this weather.

00:16:25.442 --> 00:16:26.944
That's fine.

00:16:26.944 --> 00:16:27.528
What?

00:16:29.405 --> 00:16:30.239
It's fine...

00:16:34.201 --> 00:16:36.161
Thank you!

00:17:05.482 --> 00:17:09.778
Honoka-chan, wait!

00:17:09.778 --> 00:17:12.489
Honoka, I'm always telling you.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.783
Sorry, sorry!

00:17:15.534 --> 00:17:18.579
Your timing is always off in the same place.

00:17:19.705 --> 00:17:22.041
Dancing is hard.

00:17:22.041 --> 00:17:24.209
What do you mean by "lame"?

00:17:24.209 --> 00:17:26.462
I was just being honest.

00:17:26.462 --> 00:17:28.297
Nico-chan, you never change.

00:17:28.297 --> 00:17:30.007
Thirty more seconds!

00:17:30.007 --> 00:17:32.301
Just a little more! Don't move!

00:17:32.301 --> 00:17:33.510
O-Okay...

00:17:34.261 --> 00:17:38.265
Once our break is over,
let's go over the steps.

00:17:38.265 --> 00:17:40.225
Okay!

00:17:40.225 --> 00:17:43.604
Umi-chan, I'm so tired!

00:17:49.068 --> 00:17:50.194
Khorosho.

00:18:33.028 --> 00:18:34.988
This seems to be the only available space.

00:18:34.988 --> 00:18:38.575
There's no shade, and we
can't be out here if it rains...

00:18:38.575 --> 00:18:40.703
But don't look a gift horse
in the mouth, right?

00:18:40.703 --> 00:18:45.165
I guess, but hey—we won't have to
worry about the noise up here.

00:18:45.165 --> 00:18:48.127
All right! We've gotta practice hardcore!

00:18:49.378 --> 00:18:51.630
Hey, Kotori-chan, Umi-chan.

00:18:53.799 --> 00:18:56.260
Let's see this through to the end!

00:18:58.178 --> 00:19:00.931
We saw it through to the end...

00:19:06.353 --> 00:19:12.025
hitamuki ni narerunowa suteki
It's fantastic that I can be so earnest

00:19:13.485 --> 00:19:19.116
rikutsu janai hitamukina kimochi
This illogical earnest feeling

00:19:20.117 --> 00:19:25.873
fiyuu to yuuki no ruuru wo motterukai Do
you have the rules of freedom and courage?

00:19:26.582 --> 00:19:30.169
Zenshin osorezuni
Unafraid of moving forward

00:19:30.169 --> 00:19:33.547
yorokobi wo wakachiatte
Sharing happiness

00:19:34.006 --> 00:19:41.680
futatsu dakedemo kanarazu mamoritaine
I am determined to protect these two

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.433
OH LOVE & PEACE
Oh, Love & Peace

00:19:44.433 --> 00:19:49.897
yasashii kaze ni nare kokoro
May my heart become a kind wind

00:19:49.897 --> 00:19:53.484
sousa genki wo agetai
I want to give you cheer

00:19:53.484 --> 00:19:55.819
ganbarukara
I'll do my best

00:19:55.819 --> 00:19:58.572
OH LOVE & PEACE
Oh, Love & Peace

00:19:58.572 --> 00:20:04.203
kimi ga kanashii toki zutto
Whenever you feel sad

00:20:04.203 --> 00:20:07.748
dakishimeruto chikaou
I promise to hold you

00:20:07.748 --> 00:20:10.167
wasurenaide
Don't forget

00:20:10.167 --> 00:20:14.379
mou tsurakutemo nakanaide
Don't cry, even if it hurts

00:20:14.379 --> 00:20:16.882
hitoribocchi wa
From loneliness

00:20:16.882 --> 00:20:25.098
sotsugyou shiyou LOVE & PEACE
Let's graduate, Love & Peace

00:20:29.645 --> 00:20:31.605
Well, we're going now.

00:20:34.566 --> 00:20:36.568
What now? Of all the times...

00:20:36.568 --> 00:20:37.861
S-Sorry.

00:20:39.488 --> 00:20:41.824
Huh? What!?

00:20:42.574 --> 00:20:43.867
Hanayo?

00:20:43.867 --> 00:20:45.077
What's wrong?

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.039
It's an emergency!

00:20:49.456 --> 00:20:50.541
What's wrong?

00:20:51.083 --> 00:20:54.336
I can't tell you here! We have
to go back to the club room!

00:20:54.336 --> 00:20:55.087
What?

00:20:55.087 --> 00:20:56.880
Where did this come from?

00:20:57.422 --> 00:20:59.174
What is it? Tell us!

00:20:59.174 --> 00:20:59.758
Nozomi!

00:20:59.758 --> 00:21:01.426
It's an emergency!

00:21:01.426 --> 00:21:03.053
What is it this time?

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.556
You mean it's not over yet?

00:21:05.556 --> 00:21:07.599
What do you mean? I don't get it.

00:21:07.599 --> 00:21:09.726
We'll have to go and check it out!

00:21:09.726 --> 00:21:10.394
What?

00:21:10.394 --> 00:21:13.355
Hey! Today's our graduation!

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:20.571
All right! Follow me, everyone!

00:21:34.793 --> 00:21:44.970
Kokoro ni FANFARE natrihibiku deai
Fanfare in my heart, a resonating encounter

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:52.895
itsumademo atsuimama no kimi dato
You will remain passionate forever

00:21:53.896 --> 00:21:58.150
boku wa shinjiteruyo
I believe

00:21:59.359 --> 00:22:02.696
hakken e to tabidachi e to
For discovery and departure

00:22:02.696 --> 00:22:05.741
kibou ga moeru BRAND NEW DAY
A brand new day, burning with hope

00:22:05.741 --> 00:22:08.869
omoshiroi basho ni tatou
Let's stand in an interesting place

00:22:08.869 --> 00:22:12.539
kienaine tokimeki no yohou ga
The prediction of thrills won't disappear

00:22:15.375 --> 00:22:18.378
daijoubu daijoubu tanoshimou
It's okay, it's okay! Let's have fun

00:22:18.378 --> 00:22:21.506
mutekisa genkina bokutachi
We're energetic and invincible

00:22:21.506 --> 00:22:24.384
LETS SMILE LETS SMILE hekotarenai
Let's smile, let's smile! Don't lose heart

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:28.180
mainichi HAPPY MAKER
Every day, I'm a Happy maker!

00:22:28.180 --> 00:22:31.224
Daijoubu daijoubu tanoshinde
It's okay, it's okay! Have fun

00:22:31.224 --> 00:22:34.478
mutekisa genkina bokutachi
We're energetic and invincible

00:22:34.478 --> 00:22:37.105
LETS SMILE LETS SMILE kikoeru
Let's smile, let's smile! Can you hear it?

00:22:37.522 --> 00:22:40.984
Odore minna ga daisuki
“Dance! I love everyone”

00:22:40.984 --> 00:22:44.029
ganbatte ganbatte sono saki de
After working hard, working hard

00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:47.366
sutekina koto ga okoruyo
Something splendid will happen

00:22:47.366 --> 00:22:50.285
IM OK IM OK akiramenai
I'm OK, I'm OK! I won't give up

00:22:50.285 --> 00:22:53.789
ashitamo HAPPY MAKER
I'll be a Happy maker tomorrow, too!

00:22:53.789 --> 00:22:56.875
Ganbatte ganbatte yattemite
After working hard, working hard

00:22:56.875 --> 00:23:00.212
sutekina koto ga okoruyo
Something splendid will happen

00:23:00.212 --> 00:23:03.090
IM OK IM OK sakebitai
I'm OK, I'm OK! I want to shout

00:23:03.090 --> 00:23:08.595
ikouyo minnade mottone
"Let's go! Even farther together!"

00:23:23.235 --> 00:23:24.861
Let's go!

00:23:24.861 --> 00:23:28.156
Come with us to a place
you've never seen before!

00:23:28.156 --> 00:23:30.242
A stage you've never seen before!

00:23:30.242 --> 00:23:33.245
Make our dream come true!

00:23:33.245 --> 00:23:35.414
Make your dreams come true!

00:23:36.081 --> 00:23:39.418
Make everyone's dreams come true!
